  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fca Us obligated $512M in FY2026 to date across 11,836 awards. Fca Us averaged $43.3K per award. Fca Us obligations are up 101.5% year over year. Fca Us obligations by fiscal year show variability: FY21 was $267M, FY22 was $16.1M, FY23 was $356M, FY24 was $330M, FY25 was $254M, and FY26 to date is $512M. Fca Us current-year totals are partial because the period is fiscal year to date. Fca Us figures reported here are contract obligations except for award-value figures in largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables, which are total contract values. Fca Us award count and average award size indicate a large number of relatively small awards. Fca Us year-over-year growth reflects the comparison between the current fiscal year to date and the prior fiscal period.",
